      <title>Follow-up Drill Program to NB26-003 is Underway at VR’s New Boston Copper-Moly-Tungsten-Silver Porphyry Project in Nevada</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p align="justify" style="text-align:justify;">VANCOUVER, British-Columbia, Nov.  19, 2026  (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- <strong>VR Resources Limited </strong>(“<strong>VR</strong>” or the “<strong>Company</strong>”, TSX.V: VRR, FSE: 5VR; OTCQB: VRRCF) is pleased to announce that the follow-up drill program planned for its New Boston copper-moly-tungsten-silver porphyry-skarn project in Nevada is now underway. </p>]]></description>
