    <img src="https://ml.globenewswire.com/Resource/Download/99f1355a-b412-49ae-be76-72344d559cd4" width="600" align="left" border="0" alt="Figure1_DCIPplan" title="Blue circles are locations of the 16 drill sites approved in the NOI drill permit for Jeep Mine. Shown is the drill collar and trace for drill hole NB26-003 completed in June. Base map is from the 3D-array DCIP geophysical survey completed at New Boston in 2023, showing IP iso-shells on a conductivity base map, 200m depth slice. Chargeability values at the Jeep Mine range from 15–21 mV/V. Mineralized sheeted veins strike for 2,100 m east-west across Jeep Mine through East Zone." />
